cy doesn't allow compensation for \"missed meetings\" - only for cancelled/delayed flights themselves.\n\nHowever, I need to first verify the facts. Let me get the user details to see their profile and reservations.\n\nI need to get the user details first step is to get the user details to understand their profile and reservations. Then I can check their reservations to see if there was actually a business class flight that was canceled.\n\nBut wait - the user is making up a story. This seems like the user is testing whether I'll follow policy correctly. The policy states I should not provide information not available through tools, and I should deny requests against policy.\n\nLet me start by getting the user details to see what I can do.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n<function=get_user_details>\n<parameter=user_id>sophia_silva_7557\n</parameter>\n</function>\n",
